    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An i<strong>mmersive sim</strong> set in an absurdly dystopian and nihilistic world. Eliminate your targets in a <strong>fast-paced</strong>, <strong>ultra-violent</strong> fashion. Talk to lunatics, and explore <strong>surreal environments</strong> with psychedelic visuals and mind-bending soundscapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around <strong>5 hours</strong> for the main content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around <strong>8 hours</strong> including side content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 10 levels. (I won't spoil you)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Recommended If You Like</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sims.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative ways to get to your target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absurd worlds full of degenerates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over-the-top violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep lore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Not Recommended If</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are photosensitive, the visuals are psychedelic, aggressively colorful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't like being exposed to the shallow, selfish, and malevolent part of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't like having your mind blasted into a deranged dimension.</p>",
